{
  "_about": "Team channel link vectors (note 76). Read by tests/unit/projectChannels.test.mjs and apps/ios/BanbeAppTests/ProjectChannelsTests.swift; migration 210's SQL test runs the 'lists' through sanitize_project_channels. 'detect' -> platform or null; 'channels' -> ok + cleaned fields or error; 'lists' -> ok or error.",
  "detect": [
